{"steam_appid":2669150,"steam_name":"Mindlock - The Apartment","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2669150/121675758/16f3c9edf42e586de6926ac092a17ba0075d6d5a/1768482963/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768484064","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257075140/21befae85ab50dcdddba39d118982c4c76c12a4f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768484064","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/ss_c7e37d291e41293d99a151a380bafb4be25ffd2f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768484064","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/ss_fb56c55989c409d7619a5013a6e3427334777423.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768484064","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/ss_c9d2ddc6f939caf79d7f688e58ec9f213810a50a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768484064","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/ss_53cba496ba051783ce2250bd7dac1f96e76115f6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768484064","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/ss_6cd7e1c882ec10b12d724dfd3053eafe5e9b5749.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768484064"],"about_the_game":"One surreal morning, Colin’s apartment door disappears just as he is getting ready for his monotonous job. The apartment turns into a chaotic labyrinth and some inexplicable phenomena shake Colin’s worldview.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/5b7f084dc0c647931acadeeadf465fd5.poster.avif?t=1768484064\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/5b7f084dc0c647931acadeeadf465fd5.webm?t=1768484064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/5b7f084dc0c647931acadeeadf465fd5.mp4?t=1768484064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A cryptic message written on the bathroom mirror, a mysterious puppet in his bedroom, and some emotional challenges terrify Colin. New visitors constantly appear, making Colin question his past, present and future. Will Colin discover a new meaning to his life? Or was it all just a bizarre dream?<br><br><strong>Features</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Locked in your own apartment</h2>Rooms transform, familiar faces appear as creepy characters - and there is no way for you to hide. Face the horror in your own apartment. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/164eb523f61e3759e483ff299383ac70.poster.avif?t=1768484064\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/164eb523f61e3759e483ff299383ac70.webm?t=1768484064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/164eb523f61e3759e483ff299383ac70.mp4?t=1768484064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve multifaceted puzzles</h2>Help Colin escape from his apartment and decipher hair-raising puzzles, convert household items into useful tools and free yourself from your nightmare.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/6d2f43a4ea3a7178a6c5775f906b937e.poster.avif?t=1768484064\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/6d2f43a4ea3a7178a6c5775f906b937e.webm?t=1768484064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/6d2f43a4ea3a7178a6c5775f906b937e.mp4?t=1768484064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More than 4 hours of exciting and fully soundtracked dialogues</h2>Experience a professionally dubbed adventure with many interesting characters - brought to life by professional voice actors. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/95f57a5389f78b52b8c35de7d6e30e8f.poster.avif?t=1768484064\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/95f57a5389f78b52b8c35de7d6e30e8f.webm?t=1768484064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/95f57a5389f78b52b8c35de7d6e30e8f.mp4?t=1768484064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lovingly hand drawn and animated</h2>Immerse yourself in a hand-drawn masterpiece - full of loving animations and interactions, crazy characters and a constantly changing game world. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/688134e1a60ebdb606766e6ac5146b6b.poster.avif?t=1768484064\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/688134e1a60ebdb606766e6ac5146b6b.webm?t=1768484064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/688134e1a60ebdb606766e6ac5146b6b.mp4?t=1768484064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Colin‘s fears</h2>Meet Colin and help him face his fears. Experience a complex adventure full of dry humor between harsh reality an mystical changes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/ab1a55cf285c2b584fa747bc1aadcb9b.poster.avif?t=1768484064\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/ab1a55cf285c2b584fa747bc1aadcb9b.webm?t=1768484064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/ab1a55cf285c2b584fa747bc1aadcb9b.mp4?t=1768484064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relive Colin’s memories</h2>Dive into Colin’s complex mind and find repressed memories, hidden thought processes, and long-forgotten dreams.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/aa030d4c2b1065db97241c568ea9c00a.poster.avif?t=1768484064\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/aa030d4c2b1065db97241c568ea9c00a.webm?t=1768484064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669150/extras/aa030d4c2b1065db97241c568ea9c00a.mp4?t=1768484064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz (Single Core) or 2 GHz (Dual Core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 compatible with 512 MB dedicted RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.5 GHz (Single Core) oder 3 GHz (Dual Core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 compatible with 512 MB dedicted RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure"],"developers":["Roof Cut Media"],"publishers":["USM"],"release_date":"26 Nov, 2024"}